cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "OSDR-PlantMicrobiome: a FAIR relational database, pipeline and interactive report for NASA OSDR plant-associated microbiome datasets"
abstract: >-
  A FAIR research-software tool that harvests plant-associated microbiome
  studies from the NASA Open Science Data Repository (OSDR), integrates their
  metadata into a normalised relational database, computes microbial-ecology
  diversity metrics, and renders an interactive integrated HTML report.
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: CC-BY-4.0
